1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,476
Welcome to the xPPM neo-Seoul quick tutorial.

2
00:00:03,476 --> 00:00:11,465
In about twenty minutes, you will learn how to author an information delivery manual, an IDM, from a blank project.

3
00:00:12,365 --> 00:00:17,144
Open the releases page of the xPPM neo-Seoul repository on GitHub,

4
00:00:17,144 --> 00:00:25,253
and download the file for your computer: a disk image for macOS, an installer or a portable program for Windows,

5
00:00:25,253 --> 00:00:27,063
or an AppImage for Linux.

6
00:00:27,963 --> 00:00:31,252
Install it as usual and start xPPM neo-Seoul.

7
00:00:31,252 --> 00:00:33,079
The start screen appears.

8
00:00:33,079 --> 00:00:35,857
In the next video, we start a project.

